Spec: SpecDD Code Style Settings

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Provide default IntelliJ code style settings for SpecDD files.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDCodeStyleSettingsProvider.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDCodeStyleSettingsProvider.kt

Can read:
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/SpecDDLanguageBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Provide settings for `@SpecDDLanguage`.
  Use 2 spaces for default indentation.
  Use 4 spaces for default continuation indentation.
  Use tab size 2.
  Disable tab characters by default.
  Expose standard options `INDENT_SIZE`, `TAB_SIZE`, and `USE_TAB_CHARACTER` for indent settings.
  Avoid exposing extra controls for non-indent settings.
  Provide a SpecDD code sample that demonstrates two-space indentation.

Must not:
  Add custom user-facing settings.
  Define syntax highlighting behavior.
  Define validation diagnostics.
